-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/6 (21.4.2025): עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה בחטיבה העליונה ובכיתות יג'-יד' ועדכון תוספת 87' מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים בחטיבה העליונה בעוז לתמורה
-- The index update of 1.1.2025: the 2016 shekel supplement in the upper
-- divisions and grades 13-14 (Oz LaTmura and not), and the principals'
-- '87 reform-transition supplement in Oz LaTmura, paid with arrears from
-- January 2025.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ה
-- (common.l4: September 2024 = 1, January 2025 = 5, April 2025 = 8).

§ `תשפ"ה/6 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date (21.4.2025), reference number, circular number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

@desc An amount as this circular states it: the new monthly value from 1.1.2025 and the value it replaces.
DECLARE `updated amount` HAS
    `amount from 1.1.2025` IS A NUMBER
    `amount it replaces`   IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `update action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` HAS `monthly amount paid` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    ROUND (x TIMES 100) DIVIDED BY 100

§§ `Purpose and linkage`

-- p13 and p14: under the wage agreements with the teachers' organization of
-- 14.3.2018 (5א(ב), 5ב(ב)) and 23.3.2017 (4(ד)) and circular תשפ"ד/5, the
-- 2016 shekel supplement is linked to the consumer price index; this
-- circular publishes its update from 1.1.2025.
@ref akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement is linked to the consumer price index` IS TRUE

-- p15: the linkage is the December 2024 index (published January 2025)
-- against the December 2023 index (published January 2024). The index
-- values are not in the circular; they are inputs.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN `index of December 2024` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2023` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage ratio` `index of December 2024` `index of December 2023` IS
    `index of December 2024` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2023`

GIVEN `amount before` IS A NUMBER, ratio IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `linked` `amount before` ratio IS
    `to the agora` (`amount before` TIMES ratio)

§§ `Application`

-- akn:preamble/p16 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.

DECLARE `upper-division employee` HAS
    `graded on the teaching-staff scale`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by a supervised owning body`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed under Oz LaTmura`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a principal`                             IS A BOOLEAN

-- p17 and p18: every employee graded as teaching staff, employed by an
-- owning body the Ministry supervises, in the upper divisions or grades
-- 13-14 — in Oz LaTmura or not.
@ref akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `graded on the teaching-staff scale`
    AND e's `employed by a supervised owning body`
    AND e's `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14`

§§ `א עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016`

-- akn:art_a/p1 The lead-in "from 1.1.2025 the amount will be updated to the following"; the amounts are the two rows below.

@ref akn:art_a/p2
`the 2016 supplement for Oz LaTmura teachers` MEANS
    `updated amount` WITH
        `amount from 1.1.2025` IS 1605.05
        `amount it replaces`   IS 1554.68

@ref akn:art_a/p3
`the 2016 supplement for teachers outside Oz LaTmura and for principals` MEANS
    `updated amount` WITH
        `amount from 1.1.2025` IS 1357.24
        `amount it replaces`   IS 1314.65

-- Which row applies. A principal takes the second row whether in the
-- reform or not, as the row names principals without qualification.
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` e IS
    IF NOT `the circular applies to` e
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF e's `employed under Oz LaTmura` AND NOT e's `is a principal`
         THEN `the 2016 supplement for Oz LaTmura teachers`'s `amount from 1.1.2025`
         ELSE `the 2016 supplement for teachers outside Oz LaTmura and for principals`'s `amount from 1.1.2025`

-- akn:art_a/p4 Reimbursement of the owning bodies through the hour cost in the payments system; it binds the Ministry's own accounts and sets no amount.

§§ `ב עדכון סכום תוספת 87' מעבר רפורמה למנהלים`

-- p1: under the agreement and section 18 of circular תשע"ח/9, the '87
-- reform-transition supplement of principals employed under Oz LaTmura is
-- updated by the same index.
@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_b/p2
`the '87 reform-transition supplement for Oz LaTmura principals` MEANS
    `updated amount` WITH
        `amount from 1.1.2025` IS 1170.95
        `amount it replaces`   IS 1134.20

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the '87 reform-transition supplement from 1.1.2025` e IS
    IF `the circular applies to` e AND e's `is a principal` AND e's `employed under Oz LaTmura`
    THEN `the '87 reform-transition supplement for Oz LaTmura principals`'s `amount from 1.1.2025`
    ELSE 0

-- akn:art_b/p3 The reimbursement for the '87 supplement was transferred in topic 558 of the March 2025 payments, paid early April 2025; a Ministry account entry, no rule for the owning bodies.

-- p4: both supplements are paid at their updated value, with retroactive
-- differences, from January 2025.
@ref akn:art_b/p4
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `update action`
DECIDE `pay the updated values from January 2025` e `position fraction` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST (`the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` e PLUS `the '87 reform-transition supplement from 1.1.2025` e) TIMES `position fraction`
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/6 ב: the 2016 shekel supplement and the '87 supplement are paid at their updated value, with arrears, from January 2025"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Examples. The three amounts all moved by one index ratio: the ratio the
-- Oz LaTmura row implies reproduces the other two rows to the agora.
`the ratio the Oz LaTmura row implies` MEANS
    `the 2016 supplement for Oz LaTmura teachers`'s `amount from 1.1.2025`
    DIVIDED BY `the 2016 supplement for Oz LaTmura teachers`'s `amount it replaces`

#ASSERT `linked` 1314.65 `the ratio the Oz LaTmura row implies` EQUALS 1357.24
#ASSERT `linked` 1134.20 `the ratio the Oz LaTmura row implies` EQUALS 1170.95

`an Oz LaTmura teacher` MEANS
    `upper-division employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-staff scale`             IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owning body`           IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14` IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LaTmura`                      IS TRUE
        `is a principal`                                 IS FALSE

`an Oz LaTmura principal` MEANS
    `upper-division employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-staff scale`             IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owning body`           IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14` IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LaTmura`                      IS TRUE
        `is a principal`                                 IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` `an Oz LaTmura teacher` EQUALS 1605.05
#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` `an Oz LaTmura principal` EQUALS 1357.24
#ASSERT `the '87 reform-transition supplement from 1.1.2025` `an Oz LaTmura principal` EQUALS 1170.95
#ASSERT `the '87 reform-transition supplement from 1.1.2025` `an Oz LaTmura teacher` EQUALS 0

#TRACE `pay the updated values from January 2025` `an Oz LaTmura principal` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` 2528.19 AT 9
#TRACE `pay the updated values from January 2025` `an Oz LaTmura principal` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` 2448.85 AT 9
